## Why This Is Asked
This question probes ability to design a cross-domain reliability strategy spanning data engineering and product delivery, with measurable outcomes, not just tech debt.

## Key Concepts
- Data quality SLOs and error budgets
- Incident response and cross-team rituals
- Experimentation plan and rollout

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo example: simple retry policy for ingestion
async function ingestWithRetry(payload){
  let attempts = 0;
  while(attempts < 3){
    try { await send(payload); return; } catch(e){ attempts++; await sleep(1000 * attempts); }
  }
  throw new Error('Ingestion failed');
}
```

